From: Onigiri
Subject: [PATCH] Keep camera IDs stable on the fixed cover

The vendor folded-camera path substitutes the rear sensor for camera 1,
but its still-capture pipeline retains the original camera mapping and
crashes. Keep reporting the covered front lens without enabling that
substitution; rear capture remains available through its normal IDs.

diff --git a/smali_classes2/com/samsung/android/camera/CameraServiceWorker$DeviceStateListener.smali b/smali_classes2/com/samsung/android/camera/CameraServiceWorker$DeviceStateListener.smali
--- a/smali_classes2/com/samsung/android/camera/CameraServiceWorker$DeviceStateListener.smali
+++ b/smali_classes2/com/samsung/android/camera/CameraServiceWorker$DeviceStateListener.smali
@@ -157,7 +157,7 @@
     goto :goto_2
 
     :cond_2
-    const-wide/16 v0, 0x6
+    const-wide/16 v0, 0x2
 
     if-nez v2, :cond_3
 
